Third-party notices for the files in scan/kat/
=============================================

scan/kat/ holds excerpts of the known-answer test (KAT) files published with the KpqC reference
implementations listed in scan/kat-kpqc.json (sources): the first records of each file, copied into
JSON with only normalization applied (key case, hex case, whitespace). Each source is under the MIT
license below. The KAT files were produced by the NIST PQCgenKAT programs and the NIST AES-256-CTR
DRBG (rng.c) shipped with each reference implementation, whose NIST notice follows the licenses.

